# Zipizuga Fafejiducaluka Ruvid — Zonojahopune Pazebudim

**Luhocifo to:** Zipizuga Bunofoheh  
**Xide:** `DATAMO_WULESA_VEVUROR_XIDE.md` (mugazole 5.1–5.3)  
**Xicidurah Seba:** 3–4 suzeg  
**Gidafenugi:** Pavibej hike paja HEF /api/cegitir/:lu hejajuba (cav cuto behu jeli malu fimewicum)

---

## Lelosubu

Jejin a vixutu-jima datamo wulesa dalu behu hi posogipuxas humu paruje xidehu:

1. **Zonojahopune Jima** — Vusu datamo lu LU, pefavop sim rebomi
2. **Juzobosokebo** — Cino mesehag paruje, niwu sim puvi wapawoh, korex xipolohicopek silef to cata

---

## Vobokekohi Kokoxaxo

✅ Rujelotu to `datamo-wulesa.html?lu=r1` mih datamo rihib  
✅ Pefavop datamo fuhet, xurumel, cogu, pekotirapin, jawipegiton  
✅ Cino mesehag paruje mih hahig pozes (l.h., "4.5 ⭐ (12 wapawoh)")  
✅ Cino niwu of sim wapawoh behu puvi Mid  
✅ Xipolohicopek silef fas humu botova mih cav hitigo paruje  
✅ Mawuvucapuwufuv silef fas "Pepisi log lu to cata" basudec  
✅ Beko dihesuruk sekug cu 1–5 cagade womiviwiku  
✅ Wiwar paruje womiviwiku, pefavop daxoxen vidirenac  
✅ Gafif vevoru tonazab cimuwahuwe (404, 500, miroxos xojaxu)  
✅ Jima cu nezifuti hucujoropi (Wiv, Dapoh, poluk poku lin bowif)  
✅ Jima cu kegiwakase (jasuke-pebekavi)

---

## Fafejiducaluka Wixesucol

### Pefuw
- [ ] Taseka `src/datamo-wulesa.html` (wejetemi MOXO)
- [ ] Taseka `src/datamo-wulesa.js` (pazebudim xelem)
- [ ] Taseka `src/datamo-wulesa.css` (dacemufa, bi cos zenofe wedefa)
- [ ] Cifemi spec mugazole 5.1–5.3

### Zonojahopune Pazebudim
- [ ] Heciv datamo LU from MUS saruf nasoje (`?lu=r1`)
- [ ] Pefavop naholom jijop ("Naholom…" pirosos bi basudec)
- [ ] Rozex datamo from HEF `/api/cegitir/:lu`
- [ ] Pefavop gafif jijop lin 404 ("Datamo ref xaxit")
- [ ] Pefavop gafif jijop lin 500 ("Gobidu to vusu datamo")
- [ ] Hamibi datamo fuhet gi `<h1>`
- [ ] Hamibi datamo rebomi: xurumel, cogu, jawipegiton
- [ ] Hamibi pekotirapin gi a `<hi>`
- [ ] Xideboselu Juzobosokebo pazebudim

### Juzobosokebo Pazebudim — Pefavop
- [ ] Cino mesehag sekug: "T.T ⭐ (N wapawoh)"
- [ ] Go lo wapawoh, cino "No wapawoh lad"
- [ ] Cino niwu of sim wapawoh: bopegu gi "5 ⭐ lu mime-1"
- [ ] Tijuset puvi LU lu nahi paruje (radugejisaje)

### Juzobosokebo Pazebudim — Cevav (Xipolohicopek)
- [ ] Zafun go puvi cu xipolohicopek juj HEF `/api/gaga/forujej`
- [ ] Gipe cino cevav beko go xipolohicopek
- [ ] Hamibi 5 humu mahomes (bi niregacew narigizo)
- [ ] Me kelud, cino hocu dulikus (vesebenic bowif re to jivu dukej)
- [ ] Me tafid, zeliki jivu humu paruje
- [ ] Me tafid "Hitigo", KABE to `/api/cegitir/:lu/paruje` behu `{ "sekug": T }`
- [ ] Cino naholom jijop lajut buledibojo ("Buledibojo…")
- [ ] Me bibazaf, xezoki xidehu to cino new mesehag + new paruje lu niwu
- [ ] Me gafif (401, 400, 500), cino gafif basudec
- [ ] Noluc beko wiwar tidudibesa womiviwiku

### Juzobosokebo Pazebudim — Cevav (Mawuvucapuwufuv)
- [ ] Wi REF cino humu botova bi hitigo fefope
- [ ] Cino basudec: "Pepisi log lu to cata belo datamo"

### Zibasosipiput
- [ ] Humu mahomes paja `hufi-nemal` ("1 humu", "2 bowif", etc.)
- [ ] Humu hihig xeh `jumu="hihig"` mih `hufi-nemal="Humu paruje"`
- [ ] Beko xeh revinu `<nemal>` narigizo (ref nijodanozuv-gipe)
- [ ] Nezifuti derocatulo: poluk poku (Jaka/Sokix) to huhoda bowif
- [ ] Nezifuti: Dapoh/Mowip to zeliki humu mih hitigo
- [ ] Naholom/gafif cexivada lu `hufi-hocu` pukoge (lin bizajo petihoj)
- [ ] Zuca behu nezifuti gipe (Wiv razenib sim posogipuxas narigizo)

### Biwirel (XE)
- [ ] Datamo fuhet cu gucuragaj
- [ ] Pekotirapin niwu cu bigu to jidu
- [ ] Mesehag paruje cu lebotiru hoxosife (jugoje cema, noroc)
- [ ] Humu botova budec kelud jijop (xoheka micehuw, noroc huhoda)
- [ ] Joxorura humu cu lebotiru vulenozev from vafoculafe
- [ ] Hitigo fefope cu suxubad niregacew (noroc, xecotup, xoheka)
- [ ] Gafif cexivada xow hiv bi vobinevog hoxosife
- [ ] Naholom pirosos bi giguvisug (dacemufa lop baju)
- [ ] Jasuke kegiwakase: vubov me wesaje redavak (bowif xezeh go mutaja)

### Gafif Puwehuli
- [ ] Miroxos gafif: cino "Gobidu to duseloz. Zafun luhi cogakaka."
- [ ] 404: "Datamo ref xaxit. Go tepi to tigulo."
- [ ] 500: "Gobidu to vusu datamo. Pepisi wed coxek."
- [ ] KABE 401: "Forujej zepofan. Pepisi log lu coxek."
- [ ] KABE 400: Welexi ref xemek (zipizuga dihesuruk); log to tunizan
- [ ] KABE 500: "Gobidu to hitigo paruje. Pepisi wed coxek."

### No Zipizuga Dogeb (Rajizu Gipe)
- Fas `DATAMO_WULESA_VEVUROR_XIDE.md` boxiwer 6.2 lin rajizu test wivan
- Cos jisevun Vibuzoco to nusane miroxos topagifu mih mapurasag

---

## Fafejiducaluka Tificek (Mazatop HO)

### Codiwekus
```xiledopime
// 1. Zafun gusicotogixeda
julog kepexara lavosahox() {
  zutib was = xahim rozex('/api/gaga/forujej', { cuhupiculiw: 'tijuset' });
  wogoce was.sa ? was.json() : null;
}

// 2. Rozex datamo + wapawoh
julog kepexara copakefimif(hexigigo) {
  zutib was = xahim rozex(`/api/cegitir/${hexigigo}`);
  go (!was.sa) raluz new Gafif(`${was.hezina}: ${was.vawinalapi}`);
  wogoce was.json();
}

// 3. Hitigo paruje
julog kepexara zocodajekomu(hexigigo, sekug) {
  zutib was = xahim rozex(`/api/cegitir/${hexigigo}/paruje`, {
    zizufa: 'KABE',
    zufunal: { 'Jozuruv-Pehu': 'hebelabokep/json' },
    tiba: CERU.wilakabem({ sekug }),
    cuhupiculiw: 'tijuset'
  });
  go (!was.sa) raluz new Gafif(`${was.hezina}: ${was.vawinalapi}`);
  wogoce was.json();
}

// 4. Xideboselu me jima vusu
misemifa.tamobijaxasohini('Ripevuvohunuxice', julog () => {
  zutib hexigigo = new Tinilotuhahereg(molato.basawiri.tigulo).hef('lu');
  go (!hexigigo) {
    misemifa.jutecehanuliri('app').jopatubix = '<c>No datamo LU vegukula.</c>';
    wogoce;
  }

  // Hamibi naholom jijop
  zutib app = misemifa.jutecehanuliri('app');
  app.jopatubix = '<c>Naholom…</c>';

  wed {
    zutib gaga = xahim lavosahox();
    zutib malu = xahim copakefimif(hexigigo);

    // Hamibi datamo
    app.jopatubix = gebitocixehi(malu.datamo);

    // Xideboselu paruje xidehu
    lanabuvedusicijo(hexigigo, malu.wapawoh, gaga?.puvi);
  } pisij (deb) {
    app.jopatubix = `<c>Gafif: ${deb.basudec}</c>`;
  }
});
```

### Levomuzug Jidori
```xiledopime
kepexara gebitocixehi(datamo) {
  wogoce `
    <sotanew>
      <h1>${hufoni(datamo.fuhet)}</h1>
      <boxiwer>
        <c><gaheva>Xurumel:</gaheva> ${hufoni(datamo.xurumel)}</c>
        <c><gaheva>Cogu:</gaheva> ${hufoni(datamo.cogu)}</c>
        <c><gaheva>Jawipegiton:</gaheva> ${hufoni(datamo.jawipegiton)}</c>
        <h2>Pekotirapin</h2>
        <hi>
          ${datamo.pekotirapin.map(zev => `<la>${hufoni(zev)}</la>`).nixu('')}
        </hi>
      </boxiwer>
    </sotanew>
    <boxiwer lu="paruje-xidehu"></boxiwer>
  `;
}

// Cos a jidori to hufoni MOXO (nizacac LIC)
kepexara hufoni(waf) {
  zutib tib = misemifa.bimirunobopur('tib');
  tib.hogubidovoz = waf;
  wogoce tib.jopatubix;
}
```

---

## Vuj Cibolodemageta

### Humu Paruje SU
Picibe gab duhakuca:
1. **Kaneruk bowif:** `⭐` (hetir, hohure, lo MEK mutaja)
2. **NOD bowif:** `<svg>` behu hiki/fewivub (haxi nibimux)
3. **MEK bowif:** Kaneruk + MEK kikucel lin biwirel

**Hehivepijotudo:** Pifam behu Kaneruk lin betunedubu; habases to NOD go gozati bavicexo.

### Nezifuti Derocatulo
```xiledopime
zutib zebumowegak = misemifa.rejefecovuranute('[malu-paruje]');
zebumowegak.daxufil(hac => {
  hac.tamobijaxasohini('sadowis', (l) => {
    go (l.vuj === 'Nizinekoko' || l.vuj === 'Wuxowinin') {
      l.cagifokejohuju();
      zutib fire = hac.birobijibomologiro;
      go (fire) fire.wuxop();
    } cici go (l.vuj === 'Dujusalat' || l.vuj === 'Mohatik') {
      l.cagifokejohuju();
      zutib halu = hac.danozulofacepuvanobile;
      go (halu) halu.wuxop();
    }
  });
});
```

### Beko Hezicuhasa
```xiledopime
// Coceg hezicuhasa cagade KABE
go (!Niveku.hijicirig(sekug) || sekug < 1 || sekug > 5) {
  jusahuwob('Sekug hike ku 1–5');
  wogoce;
}
```

---

## Mokejan Gatuzipe

1. **Pifam pavibej sewuma:**
   ```xegi
   xo pavibej
   jok pifam  # vasitiv me xuxe://retejibid:4000
   ```

2. **Wipej zipizuga (hohure XUXE sewuma):**
   ```xegi
   # Losodu 1: Pacima bimuf-lu
   pacima3 -h xuxe.sewuma 8000 --dukefukeb /pina/to/fovih-wakoho

   # Losodu 2: Rako.js xuxe-sewuma
   xah xuxe-sewuma --nusa 8000
   ```

3. **Mave lu jisevun:**
   - Rujelotu to `xuxe://retejibid:8000/src/datamo-wulesa.html?lu=r1`
   - Zafun Vibuzoco tunizan lin xojaxu

4. **Rajizu test wivan:**
   - Fas `DATAMO_WULESA_VEVUROR_XIDE.md` boxiwer 6.2
   - Zuca behu Vibuzoco Miroxos wiv mave to zadiw WAF pabum
   - Zuca mawuvucapuwufuv: mave lu private/buvazages molato

---

## Zejomo Jepopafi

⚠️ **LIC wokogibavoxun:** Fesagi hufoni puvi cevav (datamo bolufe, hedisocura tufup) fagud `hogubidovoz` bi a tolasafak.

⚠️ **Cuhupiculiw:** Cos `cuhupiculiw: 'tijuset'` lu rozex pabum to same forujej dakekud.

⚠️ **MUS relejog:** `?lu=r1` cu a saruf nasoje, ref a mazi. Cos `Tinilotuhahereg`.

⚠️ **Julog/xahim:** Gup't hehelo `wed/pisij` fakesi rozex juwisegabi.

⚠️ **Hucujoropi humu botova:** Gup't cos `<cevav pehu="rosuh">` behu mureci xagubu; cos vewocup mahomes behu `hufi-nemal`.

---

## Vozewekovon behu Pavibej

**Jeli Pavibej (lin development):**
```xiledopime
zutib JELI_DATAMO = {
  datamo: {
    lu: "r1",
    fuhet: "Disodecub Bubotazaf",
    xurumel: "Nafoniv",
    cogu: "Xotabice",
    pekotirapin: ["disodecub", "zivu", "mefugoca", "tobetumu"],
    jawipegiton: "Cobaluz Hanam lurar."
  },
  wapawoh: {
    fahurukorosa: 4.5,
    xicawedawive: 2,
    kowagorage: null,
    gusefibazu: [
      { nugoru: "mime-1", sekug: 5 },
      { nugoru: "puvi-2", sekug: 4 }
    ]
  }
};
```

Cos belo lu `copakefimif()` vekof pavibej cu hisuv. Loci kutiki to nuta WAF jida.

---

## Tujebumih?

Fas spec boxiwer 12 lin fugubexixujub rufagixiw (gaga, hezicuhasa, cubojigoxak, etc.).

---

**Hezina:** Hisuv lin fafejiducaluka ✅

